OL,3,GNEWSAFilm buff brings community cinema
OL,4,Aback to town
OL,5,
OL,6,FA film fan wants to restore cinema
OL,7,Fscreenings to a town following the
OL,8,Fclosure of a national chain in the
OL,9,Farea.
OL,11,FWill Preston, 28, is organising a
OL,12,Fcommunity cinema event at Corn Market
OL,13,FHall in Kettering, Northamptonshire.
OL,15,FAbout 75 people are expected to attend
OL,16,Fa screening of The Rocky Horror Show on
OL,17,F30 October.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
