OL,3,GNEWSAFilm buff brings community cinema
OL,4,Aback to town
OL,5,
OL,6,FPreston said: "We'd like to do [a
OL,7,Fscreening] every month. We're moving
OL,8,Faround Kettering to all different
OL,9,Fplaces to try to keep it accessible and
OL,10,Fget as many people to enjoy the cinema
OL,11,Fexperience as possible."
